      "The company ceased receiving other operating income, which contributed £11,639 in the prior year.",
      "Staff costs remain the largest overhead, though they were successfully scaled down in line with falling turnover.",
      "Overall profitability has increased in absolute terms, but the declining revenue trend is a potential red flag for future growth."
